Hi {Owner},

I build websites for dog boarding and daycare facilities around {City}. {Business Name} has happy play-yard posts on its social pages, but no site where an owner can check holiday boarding dates, read your rules and request a stay.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a holiday boarding calendar with minimum stays, a temperament-test request, a day-in-playgroup page and an intake form for vaccination records, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and date changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone during your midday quiet time?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
